  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2001.19 \"Uniform chart of accounts\" means the account titles, descriptions, and numbering classification system expressed in this chapter established by the department in accordance with RSA 21-J:13, III.\n\nSource. #10675, eff 9-24-14 (from Rev 2001.14); ss by #14072, eff 9-10-24 (formerly Rev 2001.17)",
